  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/DataDog/dd-trace-java/zipball/v1.68.1",
  "body": "# Components\r\n\r\n## Profiling\r\n\r\n* :bug: Bump java-profiler (ddprof) to 1.52.1 (#13137 - @jbachorik)\r\n  * Measure native allocator overhead instead of assuming a fixed factor\r\n  * Improve stack frame attribution and AArch64 runtime stub unwinding\r\n  * Record the remote symbolication mode in JFR \r\n  * Add upstream reference-chain tracking and leak-signal detection, with liveness and recycled-tag identity fixes\r\n  * Fix dictionary and call-trace table reclamation after drain timeouts, preserve string IDs across dictionary rotation, and correct live-trace preservation\r\n  * Fix duplicate and biased thread selection in wall-clock sampling, native socket hook timestamps, and continuation metadata lookup and frame alignment\r\n  * Add the upstream fjmethodid=lazy option for profiling HotSpot without jmethodIDs \r\n\r\n## Tracer core\r\n\r\n* :bug: Fix stale type descriptions when transforming multi-release classes (#13134 - @mcculls)\r\n\r\n# Instrumentations\r\n\r\n## Netty instrumentation\r\n\r\n* :bug: Fix Netty client disconnects being reported as trace errors (#13168 - @ygree)\r\n\r\n",
  "mentions_count": 3
